WEBVTT

NOTE Timing is estimated from script and acoustic pauses; listening review pending.

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:02.945
One message does not
fit every audience.

00:00:02.945 --> 00:00:08.198
The founder needs the magnitude,
customer risk, recommendation,

00:00:08.198 --> 00:00:13.650
and deadline. Marketing needs the
exact variants and campaign changes.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.500
Customer Service needs the affected
customers, approved language, and

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.637
contact deadline. The supplier needs
quantities, shipment dates, and

00:00:22.637 --> 00:00:24.625
confirmation requirements.

00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:29.210
The facts do not change.
The altitude does.

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.870
Start at the highest useful level.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:35.830
Keep supporting detail ready for the
person who must validate or execute.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.620
Too little detail prevents action.

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:41.610
Too much detail hides the decision.

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:46.617
This is not permission to
tell different stories to

00:00:46.617 --> 00:00:51.978
different people. It is a responsibility
to organize the same truth

00:00:51.978 --> 00:00:53.660
around each audience’s role.
